  "body": "## [1.2.3](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Projects/compare/v1.2.2...v1.2.3) (2026-11-02)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **ci:** adopt current tenant native endpoint binding ([bdf7094](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Projects/commit/bdf70940958a76eed2a8adb89d7c655557f07bcc))\n* **ci:** align native query and admin source budgets ([d5b3f5a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Projects/commit/d5b3f5a6955b8447b13f85cbbd1cc8fa8d8f4bec))\n* **ci:** align tenant host budget with native authority checks ([695ad27](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Projects/commit/695ad27422f51f6ac05e80fd56e66abee1f0434e))\n* **ci:** finalize current sdk and module release qualification ([c1be46b](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Projects/commit/c1be46b27690aae360315177555a1f1520752bba))\n* **ci:** synchronize current module fixes and published dependencies ([5027aee](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Projects/commit/5027aee0fd56808bcfaa2ac150d1553bcc34191a))\n* **ci:** synchronize durable delivery and current main modules ([cfb67ef](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Projects/commit/cfb67ef52472291c43b443965f92d6f3e54a0ce7))\n* **ci:** synchronize the tenant query budget repair ([5c201a7](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Projects/commit/5c201a79bd0f8ecd7987d5a6e2ba21a1f264ea44))\n"
